<title>USA: Surinam buys 2,800 tonnes PL 480 spring wheat.</title>
<headline>Surinam buys 2,800 tonnes PL 480 spring wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Surinam bought 2,800 tonnes U.S. northern spring/dark northern spring wheat under the PL 480 export program on September 27, the U.S. Department of Agriculture said.</p>
<p>Shipment is set for October 10-25. The wheat was acquired from Cargill Inc at $186.09 a tonne, FOB, U.S. Gulf.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
